      "message": "Because `USB_IFACE_MSC` and `USB_EP_MSC` are gated behind `#ifdef SECTION_IS_RO`, as soon as `servo_v4p1` performs its standard boot sysjump from `RO` to `RW`, Interface 1 reverts to `USB_IFACE_EMPTY` (`bNumEndpoints \u003d 0`) and `usb_msc.py` disables itself with `\"USB MSC endpoint not supported by current servo_v4p1 EC firmware\"`. (See also crrev.com/c/8119542 / go/servo-v4p1-virtual-usb for how MSC can be multiplexed over the existing `Interface 4` `USART4` stream so it works across both stock `RO` and `RW` firmware without needing a new USB endpoint.)",
